# The cpp resolution bundle lever (#11570).
#
# Add one `<issue>-<slug>` line when a change alters the persisted per-file
# cpp resolution bundle for unchanged source: stored interiors and unit
# summaries produced under an earlier identity are withdrawn and relowered.
# Whoever adds a line must also ask whether both ICFG provider domains rotate
# (see .agents/docs/cache-identity-levers.md). Git merges this file with
# merge=union, so two branches that each add a line keep both. Never edit or
# remove a line; compaction replaces a prefix with a checkpoint line and keeps
# the identity.
#
# Replaced the string literal:
